    {
      "speaker": "Felicjan Janus Twardowski",
      "content": "<div class=\"beyond20-message\"><div class=\"beyond20-header\"><img class=\"beyond20-character-avatar\" src=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/avatars/51436/558/1581111423-114940824.jpeg?width=150&amp;height=150&amp;fit=crop&amp;quality=95&amp;auto=webp\" title=\"False Life\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" /><details><summary><a>False Life</a></summary><table><tbody><tr><td><i>Legacy •  1st Level Necromancy (Cast at 1st Level)</i></td></tr><tr><td><b>Casting Time</b></td><td>1 action</td></tr><tr><td><b>Duration</b></td><td>1 hour</td></tr><tr><td><b>Components</b></td><td>V, S, M(a small amount of alcohol or distilled spirits)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Range</b></td><td>Self</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"beyond20-description\">Bolstering yourself with a necromantic facsimile of life, you gain <span class=\"ct-beyond20-custom-roll\"><strong>1d4 + 4</strong><img class=\"ct-beyond20-custom-icon\" src=\"/modules/beyond20/images/icons/icon20.png\" style=\"margin-right:3px;margin-left:3px;border:0px\" /><span class=\"beyond20-roll-formula\" style=\"display:none\">1d4 + 4</span></span> temporary hit points for the duration.<br /><br /><b>At Higher levels.</b> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you gain 5 additional temporary hit points for each slot level above 1st.</div></details></div><div class=\"beyond20-roll-result\"><b>Range: </b><span>Self</span></div><div class=\"beyond20-roll-result\"><b>Cast at: </b><span>1st Level</span></div><div class=\"beyond20-roll-result\"><b>Components: : </b><span>V, S, M(a small amount of alcohol or distilled spirits)</span></div><div class=\"beyond20-roll-result beyond20-roll-damage beyond20-healing\"><b>Temp HP: </b><span class=\"beyond20-tooltip\"><span class=\"beyond20-roll-value beyond20-roll-detail-fail beyond20-roll-total dice-total\">5</span><span class=\"dice-roll beyond20-tooltip-content\"><div class=\"dice-formula beyond20-roll-formula\">1d4 + 4</div><div class=\"beyond20-roll-tooltip